<title>USA: Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were steady. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers - Select to mostly Choice 2-4, 1100-1350 lbs 68.00-69.00, small load 69.75. Select 65.50-68.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers - Select to mainly Choice 2-4, 975-1200 lbs 68.00-69.00, occasional load and part load 69.25-69.75. Select 65.00-68.00.</p>
</text>
